"Snapshot Time Machine" = "Time Machine Snapshots";
"Lihat snapshot lokal Time Machine yang membuat disk terlihat penuh — dengan penjelasan jujur soal purgeable space." = "See the local Time Machine snapshots that make your disk look full — with an honest explanation of purgeable space.";
