"Apa itu snapshot lokal?" = "What are local snapshots?";
"Saat Time Machine membackup, macOS menyimpan snapshot lokal APFS — inilah yang sering membuat disk \"terlihat penuh\" padahal kosong di Finder." = "When Time Machine backs up, macOS stores local APFS snapshots — often why the disk \"looks full\" with nothing visible in Finder.";
"Ruang ini bersifat purgeable: macOS otomatis mengambilnya kembali saat disk benar-benar butuh ruang. Ini perilaku normal, bukan kebocoran." = "This space is purgeable: macOS automatically reclaims it when the disk truly needs room. That's normal behavior, not a leak.";
