"Hanya file di bawah folder Attachments di dalam ~/Library/Mail yang diperiksa — data email itu sendiri tidak pernah disentuh. File asli tetap ada di server mail; Mail mengunduh ulang lampiran kalau kamu membukanya lagi. Folder Mail memang dilindungi dari pemindaian otomatis; modul ini berjalan eksplisit atas permintaan kamu dan hanya memindahkan ke Trash." = "Only files under the Attachments folder inside ~/Library/Mail are checked — the email data itself is never touched. Originals stay on the mail server; Mail re-downloads an attachment when you open it again. The Mail folder is protected from automatic scanning by design; this module runs explicitly at your request and only moves files to the Trash.";

